api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1986139880","pull_request_review_id":2669251340,"id":1986139880,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc52Yhbo","diff_hunk":"@@ -481,9 +483,8 @@ RID RenderForwardMobile::_setup_render_pass_uniform_set(RenderListType p_render_\n \n \t/* we have limited ability to keep textures like this so we're moving this to a set we change before drawing geometry and just pushing the needed texture in */\n \t{\n-\t\tRD::Uniform u;\n-\t\tu.binding = 6;\n-\t\tu.uniform_type = RD::UNIFORM_TYPE_TEXTURE;\n+\t\tVector<RID> textures;\n+\t\ttextures.resize(scene_state.max_lightmaps * 2);","path":"servers/rendering/renderer_rd/forward_mobile/render_forward_mobile.cpp","commit_id":"5efcd64b2320d76107587ba84191fa20c06594f0","original_commit_id":"5efcd64b2320d76107587ba84191fa20c06594f0","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I think the better option here is just to track the textures that may have changed and only recreate the Uniforms array when we know there will be a change. \r\n\r\nBasically this function recreates the array of Uniforms every frame and then indexes into a hash map to see if we have cached this uniform set or not. Instead, with minimal tracking, we can just check if any Uniform actually changed, then only run this code when it has. Realistically, this won't run most frames. \r\n\r\nBut that is a riskier change to make, so I'd like to do it in a follow up PR as this gives us 99% of the benefit and is totally safe","created_at":"2025-03-08T19:30:16Z","updated_at":"2025-03-08T19:30:17Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103794#discussion_r1986139880","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103794","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1986139880"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103794#discussion_r1986139880"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103794"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1986139880/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":487,"original_line":487,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1986034640,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":26,"position":26,"subject_type":"line"}]